
Driver-specific options:
(To be set in the config file by parameter 'bs' under section 'bus'.)

    rpanic=num      Defines read panic threshold (default: 48)
    tpanic=num      Defines write panic threshold (default: 16)

Device options:
(To be set in the config file under section 'dev'.)

    cs_delay=num    CS set-up time in nanoseconds for DMA transfers: the
                    driver asserts CS, waits this long, then starts the
                    clock (default: 0, CS is asserted by the controller)
